      "title": "Guarantee reference-rewrite fidelity",
      "entries": [
        {
          "key": "Idea",
          "value": "a splice must never corrupt a number it was not asked to move. Only dependency references are rewritten; section references, versions, and prose numbers are preserved exactly.",
