                  "value": "`rewrite_task_entry` now visits `TaskChild::Body` blocks via `TaskEntry::body_children_mut`, so a `Requires` clause inside a nested task-body bullet is renumbered and validated like the inline and plain continuation forms. Deleting a referenced item is rejected with `MapspliceError::DanglingDependency` before any output or in-place write, leaving the target byte-identical.",
